WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:04.189
Laruva advises
that we should display Filo

00:04.190 --> 00:08.489
as the national bird of Q'ten Lo, as she has
the same markings as the Filolial Queen.

00:08.490 --> 00:13.370
And we began our march on
the Old Capital with Filo at the lead.

00:14.390 --> 00:16.540
The effect was tremendous.

00:16.820 --> 00:20.589
On the road to the Old Capital,
the towns we passed welcomed us,

00:20.590 --> 00:23.710
and we were able to bring them
under our control without a fight.

00:29.450 --> 00:33.020
I never imagined it would
have that much of an effect.

00:34.080 --> 00:37.429
The same goes for you, Raphtalia.

00:37.430 --> 00:38.349
Eh?

00:38.350 --> 00:39.940
That's right.

00:40.980 --> 00:43.779
When people see the outfit of yours,

00:43.780 --> 00:47.650
those dissatisfied with the current
Heavenly Emperor will side with us.

00:48.300 --> 00:51.280
We can expect our influence
to expand further.

00:53.530 --> 00:58.130
Thanks to Lady Raphtalia and the divine bird,
the Old Capital is already within reach.

00:58.750 --> 01:01.919
We'll wait here at this encampment
for the following troops.

01:01.920 --> 01:04.630
It should take two or three days
for everyone to assemble.

01:05.010 --> 01:08.630
I don't want to halt our advance,
but I guess there's no choice.

01:09.210 --> 01:11.409
Once we occupy the Old Capital,

01:11.410 --> 01:14.510
we'll also hold the ritual
of succession at the sanctuary.

01:15.660 --> 01:16.970
Okay...

01:17.630 --> 01:22.980
Just gaining the power doesn't mean
she becomes the new Heavenly Emperor, right?

01:23.430 --> 01:25.400
Don't overthink it.

01:26.500 --> 01:27.960
You're right.

01:35.530 --> 01:39.219
Ugh... Over here? Or over there?

01:39.220 --> 01:40.730
Which way?

01:42.160 --> 01:44.770
I heard they were around here...

01:46.390 --> 01:48.070
Maybe that's them?

01:49.050 --> 01:51.250
Alright! That way!

02:02.390 --> 02:06.110
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

03:25.520 --> 03:28.749
EPISODE 9: ZODIA

03:28.750 --> 03:32.359
As expected, they refuse
to agree to a ceasefire.

03:32.360 --> 03:35.360
Regent Makina likely
has no intention of that.

03:36.100 --> 03:40.320
Reports say government troops are being
assembled in the Old Capital as well.

03:41.300 --> 03:44.000
So they're fully prepared
to meet us head-on.

03:44.530 --> 03:46.539
It's also said that the Water Dragon Priestess,

03:46.540 --> 03:49.830
commander of the Heavenly Emperor Guard,
has already entered the Old Capital.

03:50.170 --> 03:51.840
What kind of person is she?

03:52.270 --> 03:55.650
Unfortunately, we've sent spies many times,

03:56.220 --> 03:58.570
but not a single one has returned.

04:00.450 --> 04:04.350
Sorry, I don't know much about
what's happened since I left the country.

04:04.740 --> 04:07.510
I assume it's someone
from the clan, though.

04:08.230 --> 04:12.820
So even if we make it to the Old Capital,
a clash is unavoidable.

04:13.530 --> 04:15.009
Don't let your guard down.

04:15.010 --> 04:15.530
Yes!

04:20.970 --> 04:21.490
Oh!

04:21.840 --> 04:25.580
Master, the food is ready.

04:26.100 --> 04:28.539
I'm going to check on the workshop.

04:28.540 --> 04:31.249
You all go ahead and eat first.

04:31.250 --> 04:34.409
Raphtalia and Filo,
you have the parade tomorrow,

04:34.410 --> 04:35.760
so get to bed early.

04:36.230 --> 04:39.280
Atla and Fohl, make sure
you two train after dinner.

04:40.010 --> 04:45.129
Even if it's Master Naofumi, we can't allow you
to walk alone in unfamiliar territory.

04:45.130 --> 04:47.180
Please let me act as your escort.

04:47.490 --> 04:49.190
Atla, you...

04:49.520 --> 04:53.619
Shield Hero, would you at least
let her guard you along the way?

04:53.620 --> 04:56.320
She will train or do anything after that.

04:56.660 --> 04:57.929
Fohl, that's...

04:57.930 --> 05:00.280
I said both of you should train.

05:00.720 --> 05:03.330
Stop spoiling Atla already.

05:04.740 --> 05:06.990
I'll go as your escort.

05:07.380 --> 05:12.000
She says, "I wasn't given specific orders,
so I'll guard you, Iwatani."

05:14.920 --> 05:16.579
I'm counting on you here.

05:16.580 --> 05:17.629
Yes.

05:17.630 --> 05:20.079
I'm counting on you, S'yne.

05:20.080 --> 05:23.429
My duty has been stolen away
from me because of you!

05:23.430 --> 05:25.659
Atla?! I only said that for your sake!

05:25.660 --> 05:28.269
Don't say unnecessary things again!

05:28.270 --> 05:29.230
U-Unnecessary?!

05:39.150 --> 05:40.109
Whoa!

05:40.110 --> 05:42.699
Oww! I'm sorry!

05:42.700 --> 05:44.620
No, me too...

05:45.730 --> 05:48.079
Um? What's the matter?

05:48.080 --> 05:49.829
Are you okay?

05:49.830 --> 05:50.629
Yes.

05:50.630 --> 05:55.379
Ah, could I ask you something?
Which way is the main street?

05:55.380 --> 05:56.499
The main street?

05:56.500 --> 05:57.800
In that case,

05:58.560 --> 06:01.029
just go straight down that alley.

06:01.030 --> 06:03.589
Oh, my! A talking doll!

06:03.590 --> 06:05.049
So cute!

06:05.050 --> 06:06.969
No, no, you're flattering me.

06:06.970 --> 06:09.350
Aren't you going to the main street?

06:09.710 --> 06:11.449
Ah, you're right.

06:11.450 --> 06:13.349
The main street was this way, right?

06:13.350 --> 06:14.639
No!

06:14.640 --> 06:15.559
Huh?

06:15.560 --> 06:16.899
This way.

06:16.900 --> 06:20.150
Ah, that's right!
Thank you so much.

06:23.740 --> 06:25.660
Who's that girl?

06:26.180 --> 06:27.369
Excuse me.

06:27.370 --> 06:28.909
Welcome, young boy.

06:28.910 --> 06:33.619
You've come at just the right time!
Tell him to untie me already!

06:33.620 --> 06:35.369
What's going on here?

06:35.370 --> 06:38.940
He said he was going to
ditch work and go drinking.

06:40.090 --> 06:43.049
Heave ho, heave ho.

06:43.050 --> 06:45.049
We meet again, young lady.

06:45.050 --> 06:47.049
You are as beautiful as ever.

06:47.050 --> 06:51.149
Your radiance nearly blinds me.

06:51.150 --> 06:52.459
About that sword...

06:52.460 --> 06:57.519
How is the repair progress on that cursed sword
we entrusted to you the other day?

06:57.520 --> 07:02.149
That level is such a plaything for me.

07:02.150 --> 07:03.150
However...

07:03.620 --> 07:07.869
The tools I need are only in
my workshop back in the Old Capital.

07:07.870 --> 07:11.689
Ah, I know! Young lady!
Let's search for the tools with me!

07:11.690 --> 07:15.619
If it's with you,
I'm sure we'll find the finest ones!

07:15.620 --> 07:17.499
Don't be ridiculous.

07:17.500 --> 07:21.129
Well, it does seem true that he has
a workshop in the Old Capital.

07:21.130 --> 07:25.219
I guess reforging the sword will have to wait
until after we secure the Old Capital.

07:25.220 --> 07:28.089
Um, excuse me.

07:28.090 --> 07:29.849
You're from earlier.

07:29.850 --> 07:32.379
I got lost again...

07:32.380 --> 07:33.599
Young lady!

07:33.600 --> 07:35.809
Heave ho, heave ho.

07:35.810 --> 07:37.399
What's your name?

07:37.400 --> 07:38.880
Uh...

07:39.370 --> 07:41.110
My name is Zodia.

07:41.470 --> 07:42.689
Zodia?

07:42.690 --> 07:45.179
What a wonderful name!

07:45.180 --> 07:49.069
I am the greatest blacksmith in this nation...
No, in this world!

07:49.070 --> 07:50.990
Muramasa!

07:54.160 --> 07:57.249
There's a place that serves
the most delicious sake.

07:57.250 --> 07:58.819
Won't you join me there later?

07:58.820 --> 08:01.499
Hey, hurry up and untie me!

08:01.500 --> 08:08.009
But I have to go watch the parade
for the new Heavenly Emperor soon.

08:08.010 --> 08:11.259
The parade? That's tomorrow.

08:11.260 --> 08:12.559
Ah, drat!

08:12.560 --> 08:14.639
Then allow me to guide you tomorrow.

08:14.640 --> 08:19.269
Let us deepen our bonds
with drinking sake tonight!

08:19.270 --> 08:20.500
Eh?

08:21.440 --> 08:23.979
If you're going, maybe I'll go too...

08:23.980 --> 08:25.999
No, I'm heading back.

08:26.000 --> 08:27.109
Let's go, S'yne.

08:27.110 --> 08:30.969
Come on now, don't be so cold, mister!

08:30.970 --> 08:34.169
Heave ho, heave ho.

08:34.170 --> 08:36.379
Whether it's that cursed sword
or your own gear,

08:36.380 --> 08:38.499
I'll keep forging till the day I die!

08:38.500 --> 08:40.230
I beg you!

08:40.960 --> 08:43.790
Well, guess you should humor him a bit.

08:45.130 --> 08:47.259
Sigh... Fine, can't be helped.

08:47.260 --> 08:49.630
Yay! Drinks!

08:50.000 --> 08:52.100
Yeah!

08:57.260 --> 08:59.119
Here we are.

08:59.120 --> 09:00.810
But it looks like it's closed.

09:01.210 --> 09:04.099
This is where I'm staying.

09:04.100 --> 09:06.189
The second floor is an inn.

09:06.190 --> 09:09.059
What?! Then this must be a fate itself!

09:09.060 --> 09:11.570
Don't make a ruckus out front of my inn!

09:11.940 --> 09:14.509
Times are tough right now,
we've got nothing for you.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.659
Go try somewhere else!

09:15.660 --> 09:19.119
Aw, c'mon, can't you
make an exception? Please?

09:19.120 --> 09:20.250
Oh?

09:21.150 --> 09:25.289
Welcome back. Please, come in.

09:25.290 --> 09:27.069
I'm back!

09:27.070 --> 09:29.969
Then excuse me too!

09:29.970 --> 09:32.680
Hey, hurry up and get in here.

09:35.990 --> 09:37.430
Wow!

09:37.940 --> 09:40.070
Look at these foods!

09:40.390 --> 09:42.139
Whoops.

09:42.140 --> 09:43.059
Here.

09:43.060 --> 09:44.580
Thank you.

09:45.220 --> 09:48.399
Then, let's toast to our meeting!
Cheers!

09:48.400 --> 09:51.110
Why are you the one leading this?

09:54.070 --> 09:56.280
Are you out of your mind?!

09:57.730 --> 09:59.540
You hold your liquor well.

09:59.940 --> 10:01.750
How wonderful.

10:02.710 --> 10:05.900
B-But I'm strong with liquor too...

10:06.800 --> 10:08.380
Don't push yourself.

10:09.370 --> 10:10.590
Come to think of it,

10:11.010 --> 10:13.340
I haven't asked your name, mister.

10:13.740 --> 10:15.509
I'm Naofumi Iwatani.

10:15.510 --> 10:17.939
Then I'll call you Naofumi-chan.

10:17.940 --> 10:18.850
"Chan?"

10:19.220 --> 10:21.969
Naofumi-chan, what race are you?

10:21.970 --> 10:23.389
I'm human.

10:23.390 --> 10:25.099
I'm of the Komai race.

10:25.100 --> 10:27.769
- A human and still that good with liquor?
- These cute ears and tail

10:27.770 --> 10:30.350
- Amazing! I can't lose either!
- are my charm points...

10:33.070 --> 10:35.459
Let's all play a game!

10:35.460 --> 10:36.490
A game?

10:37.950 --> 10:42.329
A game that never once failed to liven
things up... Heavenly Emperor Game!

10:42.330 --> 10:43.830
Let's play Masuzu cards!

10:45.410 --> 10:49.340
Masuzu cards, huh.
My hands are itching already.

10:49.710 --> 10:52.299
Hey, I never said I'll play.

10:52.300 --> 10:54.990
Master's fired up to play too!

10:55.630 --> 10:57.850
Alright then, let's begin!

11:01.060 --> 11:02.540
I win.

11:03.020 --> 11:06.600
What?! You've played this game before?!

11:06.960 --> 11:08.689
I know a similar one.

11:08.690 --> 11:10.939
Amazing!

11:10.940 --> 11:12.379
I'll drink too!

11:12.380 --> 11:14.019
Damn it! I lost again!

11:14.020 --> 11:16.949
Naofumi-chan is so strong!

11:16.950 --> 11:20.160
Let's do it... once more...

11:22.120 --> 11:24.260
He is finally asleep.

11:26.750 --> 11:29.250
Master, you look sleepy too.

11:29.680 --> 11:32.239
We must wake up early tomorrow.
We should head back.

11:32.240 --> 11:34.759
Eh? One more!

11:34.760 --> 11:37.259
Just one more game!

11:37.260 --> 11:39.639
You're watching the parade tomorrow, right?

11:39.640 --> 11:41.390
That's enough for today.

11:42.700 --> 11:45.689
Next time we meet,
we have to play Masuzu cards again!

11:45.690 --> 11:46.639
Promise me!

11:46.640 --> 11:48.069
Okay, okay.

11:48.070 --> 11:50.729
Then let's have a promise toast!

11:50.730 --> 11:52.570
You're still drinking?!

12:00.210 --> 12:01.869
Alright, I'll be taking my leave.

12:01.870 --> 12:06.089
Today was really so much fun.

12:06.090 --> 12:09.500
I've never had this much fun before.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.879
You're way too drunk.

12:11.880 --> 12:13.840
Oh, that's right.

12:15.990 --> 12:18.350
Here. Take this.

12:19.380 --> 12:20.840
What's this?

12:21.300 --> 12:24.599
A commemorative gift for meeting today.
A card signed by me!

12:24.600 --> 12:27.429
Ah, I actually gave it away!

12:27.430 --> 12:28.390
Hey,

12:29.010 --> 12:31.610
will you be my husband?

12:34.260 --> 12:36.689
You took it seriously, didn't you?
You totally did!

12:36.690 --> 12:39.180
I'm not humoring a drunk.

12:41.570 --> 12:43.780
Naofumi-chan, let's meet again, okay?

12:44.170 --> 12:45.739
That's a promise!

12:45.740 --> 12:48.210
Just get inside already.

12:58.420 --> 13:01.829
But I really meant it, though...

13:01.830 --> 13:04.899
THE RISING OF THE SHIELD HERO SEASON 4

13:04.900 --> 13:08.139
You really managed to find this much food.

13:08.140 --> 13:11.869
Well, it's all thanks to
the Heavenly Emperor's majesty.

13:11.870 --> 13:14.569
What exactly did you do?

13:14.570 --> 13:16.210
Here, please.

13:17.980 --> 13:19.530
Thank you very much.

13:21.310 --> 13:23.529
Hey, Big Sis! Need a hand?

13:23.530 --> 13:25.449
I'm fine.

13:25.450 --> 13:28.979
More importantly,
please stop calling me 'Big Sis.'

13:28.980 --> 13:30.749
Alright, line up over here!

13:30.750 --> 13:32.539
No cutting in line!

13:32.540 --> 13:34.499
- Ah, Fohl...
- Everyone will get their share,

13:34.500 --> 13:35.859
- 'Big Sis'?
- Everyone will get their share,

13:35.860 --> 13:37.949
- No, it's just because of last night...
- so wait your turn.

13:37.950 --> 13:39.670
- What happened?
- Yep, right here.

13:40.780 --> 13:44.890
I had a little talk about Atla with him...

13:48.640 --> 13:51.639
Honestly, you're always
like this, big brother!

13:51.640 --> 13:54.479
But I was doing it for your sake...

13:54.480 --> 13:58.510
In the end, I couldn't go with Master Naofumi!

13:58.970 --> 14:00.440
Alright, fine.

14:00.910 --> 14:03.660
I'll check if we can slip out for a bit.

14:10.570 --> 14:11.769
Alright.

14:11.770 --> 14:12.819
Fohl.

14:12.820 --> 14:16.349
Eek! I-It's not a big deal, right?!

14:16.350 --> 14:18.059
Just going outside for a little!

14:18.060 --> 14:20.939
We did my training,
and Atla says she wants to go, so...

14:20.940 --> 14:23.300
Fohl, if you don't stop her,
then who will?

14:24.970 --> 14:29.619
If you were truly thinking about Atla,
I wouldn't say a word.

14:29.620 --> 14:34.880
But right now,
it only looks like you're spoiling her.

14:35.400 --> 14:37.860
No, that's not...

14:38.380 --> 14:42.690
If this continues, it might someday
lead to something irreversible.

14:43.930 --> 14:46.889
If you really want Atla's happiness,

14:46.890 --> 14:50.560
there will be times when you must stop her,
even if it means quarreling.

14:51.620 --> 14:55.700
As her brother,
isn't it your duty to protect her?

14:58.420 --> 15:00.380
You're right, Big Sis...

15:00.800 --> 15:02.880
Eh? 'Big Sis'?

15:03.290 --> 15:07.220
Yeah, I've got to step up!

15:07.990 --> 15:11.270
I'll become a dependable
big brother, just like you!

15:13.680 --> 15:15.409
- I see.
- There's still plenty left!

15:15.410 --> 15:17.549
Kids first, please!

15:17.550 --> 15:20.360
Hm? Didn't you already get some earlier?

15:27.280 --> 15:28.490
Why...

15:40.030 --> 15:44.590
Your Majesty Heavenly Emperor!

15:47.380 --> 15:48.670
Your Majesty Heavenly Emperor!

15:56.330 --> 15:59.450
We'll finally enter the Old Capital tomorrow.

16:02.560 --> 16:04.110
W-What?!

16:05.210 --> 16:07.319
Ah, it's Naofumi-chan~

16:07.320 --> 16:08.709
You...?!

16:08.710 --> 16:10.419
Let me join too~

16:10.420 --> 16:13.180
No, wait! Don't come here!

16:17.000 --> 16:20.619
You got lost again, didn't you?

16:20.620 --> 16:22.299
Did you at least see the parade?

16:22.300 --> 16:25.299
Yep! I even got to see
the new Heavenly Emperor.

16:25.300 --> 16:26.929
Did you see them too, Naofumi-chan?

16:26.930 --> 16:29.720
Well, I did...

16:30.130 --> 16:33.349
Hey, what kind of person do you think
the new Heavenly Emperor is like?

16:33.350 --> 16:35.530
What kind of person?

16:36.640 --> 16:39.310
Why are you so hung up
on the new Heavenly Emperor?

16:40.340 --> 16:43.789
I think the current Heavenly Emperor
is doing her best too.

16:43.790 --> 16:48.070
The situation in Q'ten Lo isn't good,
and everyone's struggling.

16:49.340 --> 16:52.030
Well, with that bad governance.

16:52.380 --> 16:55.379
My work keeps getting harder too.

16:55.380 --> 16:59.309
You know, not the clean jobs?
The dirty ones?

16:59.310 --> 17:02.210
I have to do all of it.

17:02.940 --> 17:04.710
Dirty work, huh.

17:05.030 --> 17:08.749
Yeah, that! It's rough.

17:08.750 --> 17:12.930
I just want everyone to keep smiling,
but it never works out.

17:13.440 --> 17:14.640
I see.

17:15.010 --> 17:19.100
But when I came here, I saw everyone
smiling again for the first time in a while.

17:20.130 --> 17:23.659
At the center of those smiles
was the new Heavenly Emperor.

17:23.660 --> 17:29.470
Seeing that, I felt like this person might
actually know how to bring smiles to people.

17:30.460 --> 17:34.530
That's why I want to talk
to the new Heavenly Emperor.

17:35.900 --> 17:38.149
Sorry for suddenly spilling all that.

17:38.150 --> 17:39.250
No, it's fine.

17:39.970 --> 17:45.209
Oh! Let's play Masuzu cards!
We promised to play next time we met!

17:45.210 --> 17:49.129
Alright, alright.
Then let's head to our inn.

17:49.130 --> 17:51.049
It's more fun with more people.

17:51.050 --> 17:55.130
Yay! Then let's have a drink to
get pumped up before the game...

17:55.700 --> 17:56.759
Huh?

17:56.760 --> 17:57.830
It's gone...

17:58.860 --> 18:01.479
Maybe I left it in the bathhouse...

18:01.480 --> 18:04.720
I'll check the men's bath. Wait here.

18:05.190 --> 18:07.650
Okay! Thanks!

18:12.390 --> 18:14.029
I have come to pick you up.

18:14.030 --> 18:15.910
Geez...

18:22.310 --> 18:24.630
Found it. This is it, right?

18:35.850 --> 18:39.990
Being a Water Dragon Priestess
really is a tough job, huh?

18:40.520 --> 18:42.020
Of course.

18:42.460 --> 18:45.269
It's a role that serves
the Heavenly Emperor.

18:45.270 --> 18:48.399
The title Water Dragon Priestess sounds grand,

18:48.400 --> 18:51.989
but what she actually did
was lead armies into battle

18:51.990 --> 18:56.290
or carry out the death sentences
the Heavenly Emperor imposed on criminals.

18:57.030 --> 18:59.490
Criminal executions...

19:00.220 --> 19:02.009
Well...

19:02.010 --> 19:06.710
Anyone inconvenient to the Heavenly Emperor
was labeled a "criminal."

19:09.980 --> 19:12.430
Dirty work, huh...

19:13.520 --> 19:17.630
I'm sure someone from
my kind is doing it even now.

19:18.090 --> 19:20.119
It's hopeless, really.

19:20.120 --> 19:23.390
You mentioned it before
about your kind, right?

19:23.890 --> 19:28.850
Our kind has always been chosen
because we excel at combat.

19:29.590 --> 19:33.400
They even call us
the "Priestesses of Slaughter."

19:33.740 --> 19:35.889
Priestesses of Slaughter...

19:35.890 --> 19:40.029
Scary, isn't it?
Honestly, I'm terrified of it.

19:40.030 --> 19:41.240
I know.

19:41.750 --> 19:42.579
Oh?

19:42.580 --> 19:45.010
You had no choice given your position.

19:45.650 --> 19:49.060
Still, someone has to put
an end to it eventually.

19:49.690 --> 19:52.560
It's unusual to see just
the two of you together.

19:52.960 --> 19:56.339
Naofumi was comforting me.

19:56.340 --> 19:57.840
Is that so?

19:58.470 --> 19:59.970
Who knows.

20:01.690 --> 20:04.430
We'll head to the Old Capital tomorrow,
so better get to sleep.

20:04.820 --> 20:05.980
Yes.

20:30.070 --> 20:31.460
A message!

20:32.040 --> 20:37.570
Last night, a town in the rear was ambushed
by what are believed to be government troops!

20:38.630 --> 20:42.629
We left Itsuki and Rishia there...

20:42.630 --> 20:44.989
Atla, Fohl, S'yne!

20:44.990 --> 20:47.099
Take Gaelion and go reinforce them!

20:47.100 --> 20:48.720
- Of course!
- Understood.

20:57.020 --> 20:58.219
What's wrong?

20:58.220 --> 20:59.109
Here!

20:59.110 --> 21:00.749
What is it?!

21:00.750 --> 21:01.949
Report!

21:01.950 --> 21:05.539
A letter arrived from someone
claiming to be an enemy envoy!

21:05.540 --> 21:07.039
The enemy?

21:07.040 --> 21:09.739
"To the Commander of the Rebel Army.

21:09.740 --> 21:10.860
From...

21:11.510 --> 21:13.019
...the Water Dragon Priestess."

21:13.020 --> 21:15.750
The Water Dragon Priestess?
What does it say?

21:16.310 --> 21:17.919
Read it aloud.

21:17.920 --> 21:18.720
Yes.

21:19.140 --> 21:21.819
"Though last night saw
hasty actions by certain troops,

21:21.820 --> 21:27.089
they were not in accordance with my will
as commander of the government army.

21:27.090 --> 21:30.939
In this battle, I desire for both sides
to take the path of discussion,

21:30.940 --> 21:33.280
with representatives facing one another.

21:33.690 --> 21:35.379
Our side shall be represented by me.

21:35.380 --> 21:40.029
Yours shall be your commander,
or one of equivalent standing."

21:40.030 --> 21:42.069
That's awfully one-sided.

21:42.070 --> 21:45.529
For someone of my race,
that's fairly reasonable.

21:45.530 --> 21:47.449
Let me see the letter.

21:47.450 --> 21:48.390
Yes.

23:36.190 --> 23:41.020
#10 A PRAY
